{
  "_comment": "Crew content. Skills name a lever the simulation already has. Category knowledge and special traits are per person: a metals assayer does not help you grade optics. A skill with lever 'none' is carried, paid for and displayed but does nothing yet. Posts claim levers: a claimed lever is pulled only by hands on that post; an unclaimed lever is convoy-wide.",
