      "id": "trading",
      "name": "Trading",
      "levers": ["buy", "sell"],
      "blurb": "Works the counter. Only a hand on this post haggles, closes, or grades a crate; their category knowledge and bargain traits count, nobody else's."
    },
    {
      "id": "information",
      "name": "Information",
      "levers": ["intel"],
      "blurb": "Reads the nearby markets and reports what each pays. Reach and accuracy follow the best intelligence on the post."
